  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pair: ⟦{折|お}れる→折れる：01266_oreru⟧ (intransitive, to break/be folded). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{折|お}る (break/fold X).\n\nASPECT: ⟦ている→ている：noentry⟧ indicates completed action with result. {折|お}っている = 'has broken/folded.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{枝|えだ}→枝：02181_eda⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{折|お}る (break a branch)\n- ⟦{骨|ほね}→骨：02166_hone⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{折|お}る (break a bone; also: to take pains)\n- ⟦{紙|かみ}→紙：00712_kami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{折|お}る (fold paper)\n- ⟦{折|お}り{紙|がみ}→折り紙：05408_origami⟧ (origami—noun)\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{折|お}れる→折れる：01266_oreru⟧ (to lose heart—idiomatic, uses intransitive)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{骨|ほね}→骨：02166_hone⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{折|お}る (to make great efforts, take pains)\n- ⟦{足|あし}→足：00575_ashi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{折|お}る (also: to interrupt, cut short)\n\nHOMOPHONE: Don't confuse with ⟦おる→おる：01324_oru⟧ (humble form of ⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧) which is different.",
